  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "L’extra recherche est prête !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C2019006500780074007200610020007200650063006800650072006300680065002000650073007400200070007200EA007400650020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’extra quoi ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C201900650078007400720061002000710075006F00690020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelle recherche ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750065006C006C006500200072006500630068006500720063006800650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quelle question ! T’as remarqué que des failles\nvers Extra Illumis continuent d’apparaître, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’suis même sûr qu’y en a qui conduisent vers\ndes lieux totalement inconnus !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On a donc créé un système qui permet de\ndétecter ces parties d’Extra Illumis !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEt on l’a appelé l’<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>extra recherche<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> !\nTout simplement !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 149
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’en parle comme si c’était moi qui l’avais créé,\nmais en fait, tout le mérite revient à Quazar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En tout cas, grâce à ce système, on peut trouver\ndes failles extradimensionnelles spéciales<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmenant à ces zones inconnues d’Extra Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cela dit, l’extra recherche est pas tout à fait\nau point. Faut qu’on continue d’explorer<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nl’extradimension pour la finaliser.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEnfin, je dis « on », mais j’compte surtout sur toi\npour remplir des tâches extradimensionnelles !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 234
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, va remplir des tâches extradimensionnelles\npour qu’on puisse finaliser l’extra recherche !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Beau travail.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420065006100750020007400720061007600610069006C002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il semble que tu as rempli la mission que\nCorvault t’a confiée.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C002000730065006D0062006C00650020007100750065002000740075002000610073002000720065006D0070006C00690020006C00610020006D0069007300730069006F006E0020007100750065000A0043006F0072007600610075006C0074002000742019006100200063006F006E0066006900E90065002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je te conseille d’aller le voir aussi vite que\npossible. Ne le fais pas attendre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, t’as fait ce que je t’ai demandé ?\nBeau boulot !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002C002000742019006100730020006600610069007400200063006500200071007500650020006A006500200074201900610069002000640065006D0061006E006400E90020003F000A004200650061007500200062006F0075006C006F00740020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Donne-moi deux secondes, le temps de taper\nles données que t’as récoltées dans le système...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et voilà ! L’extra recherche est prête à l’emploi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200076006F0069006C00E0002000210020004C2019006500780074007200610020007200650063006800650072006300680065002000650073007400200070007200EA00740065002000E00020006C20190065006D0070006C006F00690020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Utilise l’extra recherche pour détecter des\nfailles extradimensionnelles spéciales !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si tu veux utiliser l’extra recherche, c’est par moi\nqu’il faut passer.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parfait !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007200660061006900740020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as de grandes chances de trouver des Pokémon\nspéciaux à Extra Illumis dans les lieux qu’on peut<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndécouvrir qu’avec l’extra recherche !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Par contre, faudra que tu rassembles des données\navant chaque utilisation.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je sais, c’est relou, mais ça devrait pas te poser\nde problème !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A006500200073006100690073002C002000632019006500730074002000720065006C006F0075002C0020006D006100690073002000E7006100200064006500760072006100690074002000700061007300200074006500200070006F007300650072000A00640065002000700072006F0062006C00E8006D00650020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour utiliser l’extra recherche, tu dois obtenir\ndes points de recherche extradimensionnelle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corvault vous attend...\nAllez vite à l’agence du Clan Dérouillard !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
